  "reviewedCorrespondence": [
    "Public facts wrapper shares the existing original closed request/schema/profile/resolver/preflight/context pipeline. Its Some(cut,rows) branch invokes the existing owner check_simulated_fact_selection; cell-only wrapper remains None and preserves previous behavior. No context constructor visibility changes.",
    "Diagnostic accepts exactly four legacy members or six members including both factCut and scopedFacts. A single optional member, null payload, unknown member or missing required content refuses; no unchecked fallback occurs. Success facts metadata is added only after owner checking succeeds.",
    "Existing owner validates exact result declaration/bytes/hash/cells, combined4M fact/scoped payload, scoped row arity/scan identities, subject/generation/source metadata, coverage, fact consistency and budgets; evaluates all actual rule dependencies and compares Original/Absent outcomes with scoped values.",
    "41 independent current-binary controls pass: original oracle membership; legacy cell-only route; paired-input closure; false/unknown/missing membership; trust/generation/policy/ontology declarations; subject/coverage/fact conflicts; scoped keys/type/scan names/count; original-value forgery; no inventory enrichment; empty-batch dependency preflight; joint fact payload overflow and source drift.",
    "Boundary-map change adds only the new public inspect_security_mapping_result_facts declaration to its existing core module. Existing owner-scoped test1, boundaries16 and transport6 pass in retained parent logs.",
    "Final native8 suite40.117s passes with actual original resourceId cell correspondence and in-domain forged-string refusal, plus denied resource and incoherent scoped-key controls. Native tests reuse fixture capture and do not establish authenticated facts."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Caller-declared trusted/completeness/generation values are premises, not authenticated custody or issuer evidence.",
    "Successful inspection checks the supplied result/scoped-row correspondence and owner policy fold. It does not enumerate all native rows, prove native SQL lineage/query predicate execution, establish a held source/writer cut, or grant protected release authority.",
    "Empty conditional batches can pass when dependencies are complete; this is not a completeness or non-omission theorem.",
    "The new diagnostic path is single-column fixture composition; no registered production result transport or full multi-scan/native qualification is claimed.",
    "Existing retained payload/work bounds are reused and no total CPU/process/native heap guarantee is inferred.",
    "No security-ready status or required backend acceptance case is promoted."
  ]
